{"title":"Harbor Seal","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 3 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"seal-blubber\" title=\"Seal Blubber - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/a28f15f016dc1a58b491.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Seal Blubber</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1256.8px,-77.0px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/4/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/4/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:1256.8px;top:77.0px\"></i></div><figcaption>Plymouth Wharf</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"harbor-seal\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wildlife: <a href=\"#/monster/seagull\">Seagull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rabbit\">Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chicken\">Chicken</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frog\">Frog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/arctic-hare\">Arctic Hare</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/crab\">Crab</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/deer\">Deer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sheep\">Sheep</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/snow-fox\">Snow Fox</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-black\">Black Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-brown\">Brown Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-white\">White Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/7ad1e4aa580c84edf0ff.svg\" alt=\"Harbor Seal\"></div><h3>Harbor Seal</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>3 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 3–3)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>